Package: foundry-emulators-consoles
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 ares,
 bsnes-jg,
 desmume,
 fceux,
 frotz,
 mame,
 mednafen,
 mgba-qt,
 ppsspp,
 sameboy,
 scummvm,
 snes9x-gtk,
 stella,
 xemu
Description: light console and adventure-engine emulators
 Universe-only console/handheld emulators plus adventure-engine
 interpreters, and Foundry-packaged emulators for platforms not in
 Ubuntu universe:
 .
   * ares        accurate multi-system: ColecoVision, MSX/MSX2, SG-1000,
                 Neo Geo Pocket, WonderSwan, Mega Drive/CD/32X
   * bsnes-jg    cycle-accurate Super Nintendo / Super Famicom (Foundry apt)
   * desmume     Nintendo DS
   * fceux       NES / Famicom
   * frotz       Z-machine interpreter for Infocom-style text adventures
   * mame        arcade + 49,600 systems, incl. the only packaged coverage
                 of discrete-logic PONG (driver "pong"), the Magnavox
                 Odyssey ("odyssey"), and the Philips Odyssey 2 /
                 Videopac G7000 ("odyssey2", "videopac"); also ships the
                 MAME debugger. ROM/CHD utilities are in mame-tools,
                 which stays in foundry-retro-tools
   * mednafen    multi-platform (NES, SNES, GB/GBA, PC Engine, Lynx, etc.)
   * mgba-qt     Game Boy Advance (also GB/GBC)
   * ppsspp      PlayStation Portable (Foundry apt)
   * sameboy     Game Boy / Game Boy Color / Super Game Boy
   * scummvm     classic adventure-game engine (Sierra/LucasArts/Westwood)
   * snes9x-gtk  Super Nintendo (Foundry apt)
   * stella      Atari 2600
   * xemu        original Xbox (Foundry apt)
 .
 xemu needs an Xbox MCPX boot ROM, BIOS image, and hard-disk image, which
 are copyrighted and not shipped — supply your own from hardware you own.
 .
 Heavier console emulators (Dolphin, PCSX2, Yuzu, RetroArch) live in
 foundry-emulators-consoles-heavy.
